@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = paste-login-token-here

### 创建异步诊断任务（HTTP 202，立即返回 diagnosisId）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/diagnoses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-TK-0706-001-v1

{
  "ticketNo": "TK-0706-001",
  "description": "客户已支付成功，但订单仍显示待支付，请诊断原因并生成客服回复。"
}

### 每 800ms 查询任务；终态为 SUCCESS / DEGRADED_SUCCESS / FAILED
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/diagnoses/{{diagnosisId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 查询完整报告
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/diagnoses/{{diagnosisId}}/report
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 查询当前用户最近历史
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/diagnoses?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 采纳诊断建议
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/diagnoses/{{diagnosisId}}/apply
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 丢弃诊断任务
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/diagnoses/{{diagnosisId}}/discard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
